    "modeling-and-animation": {
      "title": "Houdini / Rigging / 3D Art",
      "description": "",
      "modules": [
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Summer Industry Course</h2><div>Worked alongside a team to build a twenty second animated short. Project included daily meetings with industry professionals at DreamWorks/Meta to facilitate design and progress.<br></div><div>Responsibilities included project management, rigging lead, and sound lead.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Rigging: Maya</li><li>Bramble bushes: Maya</li><li>Leaves: Houdini</li><li>Editing: Premiere Pro</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/requiem.gif",
                  "width": 720,
                  "ratio": 0.5625,
                  "caption": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "embed",
                  "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/N0JplPk9T_A?si=WD_Ml85IzXCpdWyv"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Shell You Be Mine Scripted Rig</h2><div>This was a joint project, where my primary goal was to create a rig for the <a href=\"https://80.lv/articles/adorable-sea-creature-plushies-made-with-ue5-blender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">octopus</a>.<span class=\"gap\"></span>This bones and controls were built almost entirely using Python in Maya.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Maya</li><li>Python</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/01.gif",
                  "width": 800,
                  "ratio": 0.4183,
                  "caption": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "embed",
                  "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/yinRrmEpfr4"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Houdini MetaHuman Skeleton Automation Tool</h2><div>This project's goal is to allow a user the ability to upload any character, and have a Houdini tool automatically determine the joints/weights needed to build the metahuman skeleton to be used with existing Unreal Engine Metahuman Animation blueprints.&nbsp;<span class=\"gap\"></span>Tool's current abilities include extracting the center of major joint regions based on geometry, and systematically building finger joints based on the wrist position.<br></div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Houdini</li><li>Python</li><li>VEX</li><li>Unreal Engine 5</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/02.gif",
                  "width": 800,
                  "ratio": 0.6,
                  "caption": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "gallery",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "image",
                      "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/03.png",
                      "width": 790,
                      "ratio": 0.7,
                      "caption": null
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "image",
                      "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/04.gif",
                      "width": 800,
                      "ratio": 0.7417,
                      "caption": null
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 3,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Machine Learning (AI) Rigging Study</h2><div>This project explores&nbsp;the feasibility of generating bone structures based on provided geometry. The goal being to prove that artificial intelligence will be instrumental in automating future rigging processes. By creating systems that automatically build bone structures, we save time to allow artists to focus on creating more compelling stories!</div><div>Current developments include a l-system generator and a tube generator that are used to procedurally generate .usda files to be passed into a PyTorch dataloader and neural network.</div><div>Project is being developed with the help of a Technical Artist at Meta</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Houdini</li><li>Python</li><li>VEX</li><li>PyTorch</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 2,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/05.jpg",
                  "width": 1920,
                  "ratio": 1.3183,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Unreal Engine - Car Commercial</h2><div>Project explored the process of creating a commercial and rendering in Unreal Engine. Commercial features both custom and pre-made assets.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Maya</li><li>Substance Painter</li><li>Regard3D</li><li>Unreal Engine 5</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "embed",
                  "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/z2_Ezk-2oBI"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Houdini Procedural Planters</h2><div>Procedurally generated planters with fully customizable parameters, including color, growth, vellum, width/height,&nbsp;and Houdini's tree generator.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Houdini</li><li>Unreal Engine 5</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/06.jpg",
                  "width": 768,
                  "ratio": 0.5533,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Houdini Grass System</h2><div>Grass system used in the previous planter system.</div><div>Grass system allows for user controlled attributes such as height, placement randomness, density, color, and grass curves.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Houdini</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/07.gif",
                  "width": 720,
                  "ratio": 0.5633,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Unreal Engine 5 VR Experience</h2><div>VR user is shown four different worlds with a voice describing their destiny for whatever option they choose.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Unreal Engine 5</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/08.gif",
                  "width": 384,
                  "ratio": 0.5625,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Unreal Engine 5 Particle Animation</h2><div>\"Quantum Physics\" - Particle simulation using the Niagara system which moves the particles&nbsp;along to the audio in the scene.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Unreal Engine 5</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/modeling-and-animation/09.gif",
                  "width": 384,
                  "ratio": 0.5625,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 3,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Magnum Wolf Sculpt</h2><div>A stylized wolf character bust sculpted in ZBrush, dressed in a high-collared coat.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>ZBrush</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 2,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
