    "radiology-information-system": {
      "title": "Misc. Projects",
      "description": "",
      "modules": [
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 3,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Image Classification System</h2><div>This is the Image Classification program I made for my senior year as a Computer Science major at the University of North Georgia.</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/AlecCromer/Image-Classification-for-Machine-Learning-Systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The repository for this project is located on GitHub</a>.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Java</li><li>JavaFX</li><li>MySQL</li><li>Javaxt</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 2,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/radiology-information-system/01.jpg",
                  "width": 1700,
                  "ratio": 1.2933000000000001,
                  "caption": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "gallery",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "image",
                      "src": "assets/radiology-information-system/02.jpg",
                      "width": 1760,
                      "ratio": 1.2933000000000001,
                      "caption": null
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "image",
                      "src": "assets/radiology-information-system/03.jpg",
                      "width": 1700,
                      "ratio": 1.2933000000000001,
                      "caption": null
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Radiology Information System</h2><div>We got the opportunity to work on a fairly large project as part of our Advanced Software Engineering class in an agile environment. This project was to create a PACS (Picture Archiving and Communication System).</div><div>This project entailed following SCRUM procedures, setting up document requirements, scenarios, use cases, sequence diagrams, ER diagrams, access and control policies, programming, testing, documentation, creating user manuals, debugging, and negotiating with our \"client\".<span class=\"gap\"></span>This project was a collaborative effort between 7 individuals who all contributed to the success of our Radiology system. This page is just for a representation of this project that I took great pride in working on.<span class=\"gap\"></span>These documents, code, and more can be found on this<a href=\"https://github.com/AlecCromer/RadiologyInformationSystem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> GitHub repo.</a></div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Java</li><li>JavaFX</li><li>Scrum</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/radiology-information-system/14.png",
                  "width": 1124,
                  "ratio": 0.6,
                  "caption": "<p>The Final Patient editor View<br></p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "gallery",
                  "items": [
                    {
