            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 3,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Discord Gacha Bot</h2><div>This bot was created by parsing a couple different websites to gather data on a character's show, description, image URLs...etc. from both a Disney and Anime website. This resulted in a database of over 50,000 characters.&nbsp;<span class=\"gap\"></span>The bot itself was made in Java using multithreading, Discord JDA, MySQL, and currently runs 24/7 on a Raspberry Pi.</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/AlecCromer/DiscordGachaBot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View the code on GitHub</a></div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Java</li><li>Discord JDA</li><li>MySQL</li><li>Raspberry Pi</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 2,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/radiology-information-system/16.jpg",
                  "width": 999,
                  "ratio": 0.9967,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "valign": "center",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 9,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>Selenium Purchasing Bot</h2><div>This bot checks an items list and spins up a selenium thread for every&nbsp;best buy link entered. The website updates automatically, and when the text changes to \"Add to Cart\", the bot presses the item, plays a sound effect, and navigates to the checkout menu to lock in the item.</div><div>Built in Java using multithreading.</div><ul class=\"tags\"><li>Java</li><li>Selenium</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "stack",
              "flex": 11,
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/radiology-information-system/17.jpg",
                  "width": 1042,
                  "ratio": 0.7933,
                  "caption": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
